BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-196895@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260804T170000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260804
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260901
SUMMARY:Taste of Puglia
LOCATION:Café Q
DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: Avai
 lable\nTime: 5 PM – 9 PM\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/ev
 ents/196895\n\nThis August\, Café Q invites members to experience A Taste
  of Puglia\, a limited-time menu celebrating the rich culinary heritage of
  one of Italy's most captivating regions.\n\nAvailable exclusively during 
 dinner service\, this thoughtfully curated menu celebrates the simple eleg
 ance of Southern Italian cuisine - think handmade pastas\, fresh seafood\,
  orchard-ripened vegetables\, creamy burrata\, and exceptional olive oils.
  Pair your meal with a crisp local white or a bold Primitivo\, and discove
 r the flavors that have made Puglia one of Italy's most celebrated culinar
 y destinations.\n\nMake a Reservation.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/196895
CATEGORIES:Food & Beverage
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-196057@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260820T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260820T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260820T140000
SUMMARY: Serendipity Lunch: Back in Session 
LOCATION:The Terrace
DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: $80.00 per person\nAvailability:
  8 spots left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.
 com/events/196057\n\nContinuing the Curated Connections extension of the S
 erendipity series\, join us for a special brunch celebrating the educators
  in our community as they prepare for the start of a new school year—a s
 eason filled with fresh energy\, renewed purpose\, and the promise of new 
 possibilities.\n\nGather around a thoughtfully curated midday menu in The 
 Terrace and connect with fellow teachers\, professors\, and educators thro
 ugh engaging discussion prompts moderated by our Membership Team. With edu
 cators at the heart of the conversation\, discussions will invite reflecti
 on on the joys and challenges of teaching\, memorable moments in the class
 room\, influential mentors\, lessons learned throughout our lives\, and th
 e inspiration we carry into a new season.\n\nWhether you're returning to a
  familiar classroom\, welcoming a new group of students\, reflecting on an
  educator who shaped your own path\, or simply drawn to the sense of possi
 bility that accompanies a new academic year\, this Serendipity gathering o
 ffers a welcoming moment to connect\, exchange stories and ideas\, and lea
 ve feeling refreshed\, inspired\, and supported by community.\n\n*Tickets 
 are $80 per person\, plus tax\, and are reserved for members only. Cancell
 ations within 72 hours of the event\, or failure to attend\, will be charg
 ed in full. Please inform us of any dietary needs or restrictions by email
 ing happening@thequin.com at least 72 hours prior to the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/196057
CATEGORIES:Member Mixer
END:VEVENT
