SUMMARY:Member Meet Up: Night Shift Brewery Esplanade
LOCATION:Offsite: Night Shift Brewery Esplanade
DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 2 spots left
 \nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/19
 7999\n\nJoin fellow members for an early summer evening at Night Shift Bre
 wery on the Esplanade\, a lively outdoor beer garden set along the Charles
  River.\n\nThis casual gathering offers an easy setting to connect\, unwin
 d\, and enjoy a curated selection of beers\, hard seltzers\, wines\, and n
 on-alcoholic options. Whether catching up with familiar faces or meeting s
 omeone new\, the atmosphere is designed to be social\, welcoming\, and eff
 ortlessly enjoyable.\n\nDogs are welcome so feel free to bring your four-l
 egged companion along for the evening.\n\n*This event is complimentary and
  reserved for members only. Each member will receive two complimentary dri
 nks\, followed by a cash bar. Food will be available for purchase. We kin
 dly ask that all cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior to the star
 t of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/197999
CATEGORIES:Member Mixer
