 our of The Great Elephant Migration along the historic Commonwealth Avenu
 e Mall. Explore the stories behind the life-size elephant sculptures while
  discovering the artists\, the project's global conservation mission\, and
  the collaborative effort that brought this extraordinary public art insta
 llation to Boston.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for member
 s\, plus one registered guest. We kindly ask that all cancellations be ma
 de at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
