BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-198808@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260901T190000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260901T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260901T203000
SUMMARY:'Quin Chat: Survival Mode & What It's Costing You
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: Free\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nEve
 nt URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/198808\n\n7:00PM Reception
 \, 7:30PM Discussion\nIn a world that celebrates constant achievement\, ma
 ny founders and executives spend more time in survival mode than they real
 ize. The cost can show up in their clarity\, decision-making\, relationshi
 ps\, health\, and ultimately\, how they lead.\n\nJoin internationally reco
 gnized keynote speaker\, leadership advisor\, and bestselling author Unni 
 Turrettini for an illuminating evening exploring what happens when pressur
 e becomes your default state\, why even highly successful people can get s
 tuck there\, and how your internal state affects the way you think\, work\
 , and make decisions.\n\nDrawing from her research and global career spann
 ing law\, finance\, and leadership development\, Unni will share practical
  insights into recognizing your own survival mode patterns and shifting in
 to a state where you can think more clearly\, make better decisions\, and 
 perform under pressure without it taking such a personal toll.\n\nFollowin
 g the discussion\, members are invited to participate in an interactive Q&
 A and book signing of Unni’s newest release\, Soulware: A High Achiever
 ’s Guide to Divine Connection in the Age of AI.\n\nThis event is complim
 entary and reserved for members only. Complimentary lite bites and refresh
 ments will be served\, and copies of Soulware will be available for purcha
 se. We kindly ask that all cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior 
 to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/198808
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Chat
END:VEVENT
