BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-199491@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260910T180000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260910T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260910T193000
SUMMARY:'Quin Chat: The Art of Coexistence
LOCATION:The Reading Room
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: Free\nStatus: You are on Waitlis
 t\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/199491\n\n6:00PM Rec
 eption\, 6:30PM Discussion\nWhat does it mean for humans and wildlife to 
 thrive together in an increasingly interconnected world? Coinciding with t
 he arrival of The Great Elephant Migration in Boston\, this 'Quin Chat b
 rings together visionary voices at the forefront of conservation\, researc
 h\, and environmental storytelling for an evening of compelling conversati
 on.\n\nModerated by 'Quin Co-Founder and philanthropist\, Sandy Edgerley\,
  together with Founder of The Great Elephant Migration\, Ruth Ganesh and l
 eading scholar of human-wildlife coexistence\, Dr. Tarsh Thekaekara\, the 
 discussion will explore the ideas driving one of the world's most ambitiou
 s conservation initiatives.\n\nFrom restoring critical habitats and protec
 ting biodiversity to reimagining the relationship between people and the n
 atural world\, look forward to a conversation that examines how innovation
 \, collaboration\, and community are reshaping the future of conservation.
 \n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members only. Complimen
 tary light bites and refreshments will be served. We kindly ask that all 
 cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/199491
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Chat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-199492@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260914T170000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T190000
SUMMARY:Earthshot Innovation Challenge Pitch Competition 
LOCATION:The Pub
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Impact Fund\nPrice: Free\nStatus: You are on 
 Waitlist\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/199492\n\n5:0
 0PM Reception\, 5:30PM Program\nBefore the spotlight turns to the annual E
 arthshot Innovation Challenge Award Ceremony at the John F. Kennedy Presid
 ential Library this winter\, The 'Quin Impact Fund invites members to an e
 xclusive first look at the next generation of climate innovation.\n\nDurin
 g this special preview\, Earthshot Innovation Challenge semi-finalists wil
 l present their breakthrough concepts\, sharing bold ideas designed to add
 ress some of the world's most pressing environmental challenges. Members w
 ill hear each pitch\, engage with the ideas\, and cast their votes in real
  time to select the solution they wish to propel into the challenge finals
 \, securing at least $25\,000 in grant funding\, and raising their chances
  to be awarded the top prize of $100\,000.\n\nThis exclusive event offers 
 a unique opportunity to experience the innovation process firsthand while 
 helping elevate promising solutions before they take the stage at the form
 al competition. Be among the first to discover the visionary entrepreneurs
  shaping a more sustainable future - and play a role in recognizing the id
 eas with the greatest potential to create lasting impact.\n\n*This event i
 s complimentary and reserved for members only. Complimentary light bites 
 and refreshments will be served. We kindly ask that all cancellations be 
 made at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/199492
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Impact Fund
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-176001@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260914T183000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T210000
